Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-tk, python3-pil, xdg-utils
Recommends: pciutils, libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers, poppler-utils, libnotify-bin, xclip, wl-clipboard, tkdnd,
 pipewire-bin | pulseaudio-utils | alsa-utils
Suggests: gnome-screenshot | grim | scrot | imagemagick, python3-nbclient, python3-ipykernel
Description: Desktop application for local AI models
 Monhip combines a chat with local language models (GGUF via llama.cpp, which
 the application downloads itself) with document analysis, an expert mode for
 whole document folders, tools for working on your own computer and a
 Teamwork mode where people and their local AI assistants collaborate.
 .
 The interface is in German and English. Data is stored per user in
 ~/.local/share/monhip.
